#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:169
#: 552870d1635a4dd995f438f61c2595dc
msgid "On the Whoop and AIO versions, UART3 is tied internally to a 2.4GHz ELRS receiver module and defaulted to that protocol. On the Toothpick the SBUS pin is inverted and tied to UART3 RX and supports all ArduPilot unidirectional protocols except PPM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-betafpvf405.rst:171
#: 92d103f021e243a780acbfa548dab0c8
msgid "All units have an SBUS input which is inverted and tied to a UART:"
